{
  "name": "wf04 Daily_Top_Reels",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SETUP AFTER IMPORT (3 clicks)\n1. **Get snapshots** & **Upsert snapshot**: open each, pick your `reels_snapshots` Data table from the dropdown (the table ID is instance-specific, can't be pre-filled).\n2. **Upsert snapshot**: set Matching column = `reel_id`, and map reel_id={{$json.snap_id}}, prev_views={{$json.snap_views}}, prev_likes={{$json.snap_likes}}, prev_seen_ts={{$json.snap_seen_ts}}.\n3. **Get scraped reels**: replace with your real source (Postgres/Sheets/HTTP).\n\nMerge enriches each scraper item with prev_* from the snapshot (matched on id = reel_id).",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
